## Spacing

- Navbar offset: `main pt-16` (matches fixed `h-16` navbar)
- Section divider token: `SECTION_DIVIDE` in `lib/section-styles.ts` — `border-t border-white/[0.08]`
- Page layout: five visual blocks with grouped internal spacing

| Block | Components | Divider |
|-------|------------|---------|
| 1 | Hero + Showcase (`#home` on `<main>`) | — |
| 2 | Marquee strip | `border-y` band (`bg-brand-surface`) |
| 3 | Features + FAQ (`#features`, `#faq`) | Marquee bottom border |
| 4 | Waitlist (`#waitlist`) | `SECTION_DIVIDE` |
| 5 | Footer | `SECTION_DIVIDE` |

Grouped spacing (close but breathable):
- Hero → Showcase: Hero `pt-16 pb-12 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-14` · Showcase `pt-6 pb-16 sm:pt-8 sm:pb-20`
- Features → FAQ: Features `pt-20 pb-12 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-14` · FAQ `pt-8 pb-20 sm:pt-10 sm:pb-24`
- Marquee: `py-7 sm:py-8` · Waitlist: `py-20 sm:py-24` · Footer: `py-10 sm:py-12`

---

## Fonts

- Brand font: SF Pro (Display for headings, Text for body)
- CSS vars: `--font-display`, `--font-body`
- Do not use Outfit or DM Sans

