## Environment Variables (.env.local)

DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_...
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://app.posthog.com

Mirror all of these in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

