## Future Connections to the Main App

- Clerk: "Join Waitlist" becomes "Get Started" routing to Clerk sign-in once app is live
- Prisma + Neon: WaitlistEntry lives in the same DB — no separate database needed
- PostHog: use the same project key as the main app so waitlist and app events share one dashboard
- Stripe: pricing/billing lives in the main app, not this site